WEBVTT

00:00:11.230 --> 00:00:13.650
Close A5 and A7 barrier walls!

00:00:13.650 --> 00:00:15.120
Next is the east sector.

00:00:26.140 --> 00:00:27.990
I set one card.

00:00:28.110 --> 00:00:29.480
I end my turn.

00:00:31.590 --> 00:00:33.190
Just like I thought.

00:00:33.190 --> 00:00:39.680
Due to my Discord Counter, you 
can't summon a monster this turn!

00:00:39.830 --> 00:00:42.610
All the roads have been blocked!

00:00:53.020 --> 00:00:55.170
You no longer have an escape route!

00:00:55.170 --> 00:00:58.650
The only thing ahead of you 
is a dead end!  Give up!

00:00:58.650 --> 00:01:01.220
All you can do is surrender!

00:01:01.900 --> 00:01:03.320
Keep going!

00:01:03.490 --> 00:01:05.330
You're… Saiga.

00:01:05.330 --> 00:01:06.740
Just keep going forward!

00:01:06.740 --> 00:01:07.350
But…

00:01:07.350 --> 00:01:09.060
Go!

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:16.370
No way!  What is that punk doing?

00:01:43.100 --> 00:01:48.390
No matter how far apart we 
are, we can't be stopped

00:01:48.480 --> 00:01:53.390
That's deeply engraved into us

00:01:53.550 --> 00:02:01.950
So don't be afraid of getting hurt

00:02:04.330 --> 00:02:07.890
Break through even further

00:02:08.260 --> 00:02:13.400
While carrying you beliefs in your heart

00:02:14.870 --> 00:02:20.550
There's always only one truth

00:02:20.720 --> 00:02:24.440
So feel the voice of your heart

00:02:25.650 --> 00:02:29.230
With your unwavering emotions

00:02:29.650 --> 00:02:35.330
Seize the signs of tomorrow

00:03:04.860 --> 00:03:10.260
Dead Chase!  Weave the Bond, Turbo Warrior

00:03:14.330 --> 00:03:15.480
I see.

00:03:15.840 --> 00:03:18.220
That is another way to surrender.

00:03:20.140 --> 00:03:21.270
Duck!

00:03:32.400 --> 00:03:35.200
Don't think this is enough to escape!

00:03:35.270 --> 00:03:37.900
I'll chase you to the depths of hell!

00:03:37.900 --> 00:03:39.300
I draw!

00:03:41.070 --> 00:03:45.010
Don't let your guard down!  It's 
still the middle of a duel!

00:03:45.060 --> 00:03:49.190
From my hand, I activate the 
Speed Spell Rapid Shotwing!

00:03:50.320 --> 00:03:58.860
One of the monsters on my field gains 100 
attack points this turn for every Speed Counter!

00:04:03.980 --> 00:04:08.000
The total combined attack points 
of my two monsters is 3500!

00:04:08.000 --> 00:04:11.040
That's enough to finish off your life!

00:04:11.320 --> 00:04:14.030
Search Striker attacks you directly!

00:04:14.030 --> 00:04:16.220
Cleaver Strike!

00:04:24.190 --> 00:04:26.310
And with this, it'll be all over!

00:04:26.310 --> 00:04:30.180
Purusit Chaser attacks you again directly!

00:04:36.040 --> 00:04:38.100
I flip over my set card.

00:04:38.170 --> 00:04:40.170
Confusion Chaff.

00:04:49.120 --> 00:04:50.250
What?

00:04:51.620 --> 00:04:56.040
I can activate Confusion Chaff when you 
attack me directly for the second time.

00:04:56.110 --> 00:04:58.740
The attack is negated, 
and that monster battles

00:04:58.740 --> 00:05:01.640
against the monster that attacked 
me directly the first time.

00:05:01.640 --> 00:05:02.850
What?

00:05:17.830 --> 00:05:22.410
Damn!  I set one card and end my turn.

00:05:27.930 --> 00:05:29.510
Lift up your D-Wheel!

00:05:30.350 --> 00:05:32.250
Lift it!  Hurry!

00:05:50.080 --> 00:05:52.190
I won't let you get away!

00:06:04.140 --> 00:06:07.530
You garbage!  Did you really 
think you could escape?

00:06:11.160 --> 00:06:12.210
Saiga.

00:06:12.540 --> 00:06:13.760
Why are you here?

00:06:13.760 --> 00:06:17.040
I just wanted to see what 
would happen to the guy

00:06:17.040 --> 00:06:20.330
who kept babbling on about 
the bonds of friendship.

00:06:20.330 --> 00:06:23.840
I don't have those sentimental 
feelings about friendship.

00:06:23.860 --> 00:06:27.410
Since I did you this favor, 
you'll have to repay me in cash.

00:06:28.760 --> 00:06:30.410
What happened?

00:06:41.060 --> 00:06:42.430
Our turn!

00:06:42.660 --> 00:06:46.070
We draw!  We summon Machina Sniper!

00:06:46.190 --> 00:06:48.280
It attacks you directly!

00:06:57.250 --> 00:06:59.840
He's my best friend!

00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:04.600
I actually believed that back then.

00:07:04.750 --> 00:07:07.760
No, that's what I presumed.

00:07:13.020 --> 00:07:16.810
But at the same time, I was about 
to sever my ties with Yuji,

00:07:16.810 --> 00:07:19.810
even though I called him my friend.

00:07:20.110 --> 00:07:24.330
I was going to become single so that 
I could head to the big leagues.

00:07:29.070 --> 00:07:32.380
Here we go!  We summon Machina Sniper!

00:07:34.040 --> 00:07:37.740
Yuji, what are you doing?  
That's the wrong monster!

00:07:37.930 --> 00:07:41.830
But this is our favorite monster.

00:07:41.830 --> 00:07:43.400
We always use it for the final attack.

00:07:43.400 --> 00:07:45.100
Think harder!

00:07:45.100 --> 00:07:48.800
Do you think that strategy 
is going to work forever?

00:07:48.980 --> 00:07:50.220
We end our turn!

00:07:51.300 --> 00:07:52.770
Saiga…

00:07:54.700 --> 00:07:58.740
I told you so!  This happened 
because you selfishly summoned it!

00:07:58.850 --> 00:08:01.350
No, due to the effect from 
the graveyard, it will-

00:08:01.350 --> 00:08:04.870
Stop messing around!  Stop holding me back!

00:08:17.850 --> 00:08:19.170
Saiga!

00:08:19.210 --> 00:08:21.290
Yuji!

00:08:21.630 --> 00:08:23.100
Yuji!

00:08:36.200 --> 00:08:37.750
Yuji…

00:08:38.720 --> 00:08:40.100
Yuji!

00:08:40.320 --> 00:08:43.170
Yuji!

00:08:45.310 --> 00:08:46.910
I already told you.

00:08:46.910 --> 00:08:51.780
The more a person talks about his friends, 
the more he's only thinking about himself.

00:08:51.960 --> 00:08:58.350
You use and hurt them.  And at the 
final moment, you betray them easily.

00:08:59.510 --> 00:09:02.410
The betrayed probably can't stand it.

00:09:02.410 --> 00:09:09.280
He lived, but he had to retire.  He 
continues to live to this day hating me.

00:09:10.220 --> 00:09:12.300
Did your partner say that to you?

00:09:13.200 --> 00:09:15.550
He doesn't need to.  I know.

00:09:17.880 --> 00:09:22.170
It's true that the word 
“friend” may be an illusion.

00:09:22.290 --> 00:09:26.400
But as long as the bond remains, it's real.

00:09:28.220 --> 00:09:33.020
That's why I came to retrieve that bond.

00:09:33.590 --> 00:09:35.810
Stop!

00:09:36.380 --> 00:09:39.900
It's not over between us yet!

00:09:43.400 --> 00:09:46.200
Now it's your turn!

00:09:48.820 --> 00:09:50.350
Here I go.

00:10:08.390 --> 00:10:09.890
My turn.

00:10:12.240 --> 00:10:15.230
Discord Counter's effect 
has already worn off.

00:10:16.570 --> 00:10:19.990
From my hand,  I summon Speed Warrior.

00:10:24.390 --> 00:10:29.110
On the turn Speed Warrior is summoned, 
its attack points are doubled.

00:10:29.920 --> 00:10:31.460
Your strategies are obvious.

00:10:31.460 --> 00:10:34.950
I activate my trap card Power Bind!

00:10:35.340 --> 00:10:39.440
I can activate this card when 
the opponent summons a monster.

00:10:39.440 --> 00:10:43.020
That monster cannot attack this turn,

00:10:43.020 --> 00:10:47.020
and its attack points become 0 
until your next Standby Phase!

00:10:49.830 --> 00:10:51.600
Too bad!

00:10:51.640 --> 00:10:56.400
If its attack points doubled, it would 
have been able to destroy Search Striker!

00:10:56.560 --> 00:10:58.960
What are you going to do?

00:10:59.130 --> 00:11:03.160
From my hand, I activate the 
Speed Spell Reactor Pod.

00:11:04.580 --> 00:11:06.190
What?

00:11:06.710 --> 00:11:11.260
I can activate this card when I 
have 4 or more Speed Counters.

00:11:11.500 --> 00:11:15.780
I select one monster on my field 
with 1000-or-fewer attack points.

00:11:15.780 --> 00:11:20.840
The opponent takes damage equal to 
that monster's original attack points.

00:11:21.090 --> 00:11:25.840
You take damage equal to Speed 
Warrior's 900 attack points!

00:11:29.310 --> 00:11:32.930
How dare you do that when 
you're just garbage!

00:11:33.160 --> 00:11:35.950
I set one card and end my turn.

00:11:36.090 --> 00:11:38.570
Damn!  I draw!

00:11:39.410 --> 00:11:44.220
I'll crush that 0-attack-point 
piece of trash!

00:11:44.460 --> 00:11:48.830
Search Striker attacks Speed Warrior!

00:11:53.290 --> 00:11:54.700
I activate my trap.

00:11:54.770 --> 00:11:56.670
Scrap-Iron Scarecrow.

00:11:58.360 --> 00:12:03.500
With this card, your monster's 
attack is negated once per turn.

00:12:03.790 --> 00:12:06.390
Afterwards, it is set again on the field.

00:12:06.550 --> 00:12:10.890
Then I activate the Continous 
Trap Final Countdown!

00:12:12.050 --> 00:12:15.180
With this card, during the 
Main Phase of my turn,

00:12:15.180 --> 00:12:23.610
I can deal damage by sending 
to the graveyard this card

00:12:23.380 --> 00:12:26.960
Sending 2 cards deal 500 points of damage,

00:12:26.960 --> 00:12:30.660
3 cards deal 1500 points and 
4 cards deal 3000 points.

00:12:30.660 --> 00:12:32.630
You have 1400 life points!

00:12:32.630 --> 00:12:37.910
In other words, if I set two more cards and 
send them to the graveyard, you're done!

00:12:37.910 --> 00:12:41.170
Here I go.  I set the first card!

00:12:41.170 --> 00:12:42.840
I end my turn.

00:12:43.690 --> 00:12:47.250
Just like the card says, it's a countdown 
to your life points becoming zero.

00:12:47.250 --> 00:12:50.080
On the next turn, you will definitely lose!

00:12:51.320 --> 00:12:53.720
My turn.

00:12:54.320 --> 00:12:56.870
I switch Speed Warrior to defense position.

00:12:56.870 --> 00:13:01.060
Then I summon Healing Wave 
Generator in defense position.

00:13:01.070 --> 00:13:02.920
Starlight Wave.

00:13:05.010 --> 00:13:13.020
Once a turn, I select a monster other than 
this one, and I gain 100 life points per Level.

00:13:13.110 --> 00:13:18.840
I select Level 2 Speed Warrior, 
so I gain 200 life points.

00:13:20.130 --> 00:13:21.750
You punk.

00:13:21.750 --> 00:13:27.360
Now the number of cards he needs to set 
using Final Countdown's effect is three cards.

00:13:27.360 --> 00:13:29.620
You will survive for one extra turn.

00:13:29.730 --> 00:13:32.740
I set two cards and end my turn.

00:13:32.900 --> 00:13:34.490
My turn.

00:13:34.730 --> 00:13:38.460
I summon the Tuner Monster Torapart!

00:13:38.740 --> 00:13:44.710
Level 2 Torapart tunes 
Level 4 Search Striker!

00:13:49.810 --> 00:13:53.420
I feel the electricity.  Synchro Summon!

00:13:53.590 --> 00:13:56.220
Come, Goyo Guardian!

00:13:58.520 --> 00:14:01.890
Goyo Guardian attacks Healing Wave Generator!

00:14:02.370 --> 00:14:04.550
Goyo Lariat!

00:14:05.200 --> 00:14:06.490
I activate my trap.

00:14:06.490 --> 00:14:08.290
Scrap-Iron Scarecrow.

00:14:10.080 --> 00:14:11.890
I won't let you.

00:14:11.890 --> 00:14:15.600
Due to Torapart's monster effect,  
since it was sent to the graveyard

00:14:15.600 --> 00:14:18.900
due to a Synchro Summon, you 
can't activate trap cards!

00:14:19.170 --> 00:14:23.080
Now Goyo Guardian's monster effect activates!

00:14:24.520 --> 00:14:31.530
When your monster is destroyed, I can negate 
its destruction and gain control of that monster!

00:14:31.700 --> 00:14:35.570
Welcome, Healing Wave Generator.

00:14:35.570 --> 00:14:39.060
I'm going to use your 
life restoration effect.

00:14:39.060 --> 00:14:41.700
Starlight Wave.

00:14:43.600 --> 00:14:45.860
I'm being resurrected!

00:14:45.860 --> 00:14:51.800
Look!  I gain 600 life points, 
so I'm now at 3000 life points!

00:14:52.070 --> 00:14:58.290
And with Final Countdown, 
I set the second card!

00:14:59.870 --> 00:15:02.020
What are you going to do?

00:15:02.020 --> 00:15:07.220
If you don't win on the next turn, he'll 
set the third card, and you'll lose!

00:15:07.220 --> 00:15:08.900
Don't you know that?

00:15:09.280 --> 00:15:14.550
All I need to do is believe 
in my bond with my friends.

00:15:14.550 --> 00:15:17.220
Stop saying such stupid things!

00:15:17.220 --> 00:15:22.240
If you're definitely going to lose the duel, 
then you have to think about an alternate plan!

00:15:22.600 --> 00:15:27.400
Stop saying that the bond 
with my friends is stupid.

00:15:28.240 --> 00:15:32.500
Similar to me, you're taking 
good care of that card.

00:15:35.470 --> 00:15:40.330
That thing symbolizes that 
Yuji hasn't forgiven me!

00:15:40.330 --> 00:15:41.700
You're wrong.

00:15:42.460 --> 00:15:50.500
During the accident, your partner 
rescued that card from the flames.

00:15:50.590 --> 00:15:54.490
I can tell from the marks 
that it was repaired.

00:15:56.840 --> 00:15:58.820
No!

00:16:00.990 --> 00:16:02.930
Stop!  Don't burn!

00:16:02.930 --> 00:16:07.540
It's my precious card!  
It's our precious card!

00:16:17.040 --> 00:16:18.620
That's right.

00:16:19.220 --> 00:16:22.940
Your partner has forgiven you.

00:16:23.070 --> 00:16:27.640
Actually, he probably didn't 
even think about that.

00:16:28.060 --> 00:16:30.770
He was only thinking about one thing.

00:16:31.670 --> 00:16:35.050
He wanted to protect the 
bond he had with you.

00:16:36.110 --> 00:16:39.230
Because he didn't want to sever that bond.

00:16:39.520 --> 00:16:43.400
Because he cared about 
the bond he had with you.

00:16:45.090 --> 00:16:52.680
As long as there's a bond, you're friends 
forever.  Just like I have my friends.

00:16:52.930 --> 00:16:56.690
That's why I fight for my bond.

00:16:58.360 --> 00:16:59.830
My turn.

00:17:00.750 --> 00:17:03.150
I summon Turbo Synchron.

00:17:06.410 --> 00:17:10.050
When a Tuner Monster is on my field,

00:17:10.050 --> 00:17:15.650
I can Special Summon Quillbolt Hedgehog from 
my graveyard due to its monster effect.

00:17:16.410 --> 00:17:19.830
Turbo Synchron attacks 
Healing Wave Generator!

00:17:19.860 --> 00:17:25.360
What?  Turbo Synchron's attack points are 
less than Healing Wave Generator's defense points!

00:17:25.360 --> 00:17:27.580
Have you lost your mind?

00:17:34.020 --> 00:17:35.410
You fool.

00:17:35.410 --> 00:17:39.270
Are you committing suicide?  You 
only have 100 life points left!

00:17:39.270 --> 00:17:42.450
At this moment, Turbo Synchron's 
monster effect activates.

00:17:42.450 --> 00:17:47.980
When this monster attacks, I can Special 
Summon one monster from my hand

00:17:47.980 --> 00:17:51.980
whose attack points are equal 
or fewer than the damage I took.

00:17:52.040 --> 00:17:54.630
Appear, Sonic Chick!

00:17:55.670 --> 00:17:59.110
I flip over the trap card Urgent Tuning.

00:17:59.260 --> 00:18:02.730
With this card, I release one Tuner Monster

00:18:02.730 --> 00:18:06.630
and one or more other monsters on my field

00:18:06.630 --> 00:18:11.190
to Special Summon one Synchro Monster 
that fulfills the requirements.

00:18:11.940 --> 00:18:16.160
He has a Tuner Monster and three 
other monsters on his field.

00:18:16.160 --> 00:18:18.920
It can't be...  A Synchro 
Summon with four monsters?

00:18:19.090 --> 00:18:20.440
What?

00:18:21.950 --> 00:18:22.970
Here I go.

00:18:25.560 --> 00:18:31.250
Turbo Synchron tunes Quillbolt Hedgehog, 
Speed Warrior and Sonic Chick!

00:18:32.930 --> 00:18:38.970
The bond comes together to call forth a new 
power.  Become the path that lights the way!

00:18:39.510 --> 00:18:40.980
Synchro Summon!

00:18:40.980 --> 00:18:43.630
Come, Turbo Warrior!

00:18:48.590 --> 00:18:50.020
This is...

00:18:50.240 --> 00:18:53.480
Turbo Warrior attacks Goyo Guardian.

00:18:55.510 --> 00:18:57.770
You fool.  Have you lost your mind?

00:18:57.770 --> 00:19:02.050
Goyo Guardian has 2800 attack 
points!  They're more than yours!

00:19:02.150 --> 00:19:05.340
However, Goyo Guardian is Level 6.

00:19:05.340 --> 00:19:08.040
Due to Turbo Warrior's monster effect,

00:19:08.040 --> 00:19:11.580
the attack points of Level 
6-or-higher monsters are halved!

00:19:11.620 --> 00:19:12.790
What?

00:19:12.890 --> 00:19:14.950
High Rate Power!

00:19:20.900 --> 00:19:24.620
Even if it's destroyed in battle, 
I still have life points remaining.

00:19:24.620 --> 00:19:29.200
On my next turn, the countdown 
will lead you to zero!

00:19:31.130 --> 00:19:34.240
I activate my trap Synchro Strike.

00:19:34.240 --> 00:19:39.480
For every monster that was used 
to Synchro Symmon this turn,

00:19:39.480 --> 00:19:42.480
the Synchro Monster gains 500 attack points.

00:19:42.480 --> 00:19:43.930
What?

00:19:47.370 --> 00:19:54.500
Four monsters were used to summon the 
monster.  Therefore, it has 4500 attack points?

00:19:54.500 --> 00:19:56.690
That's crazy!

00:19:57.660 --> 00:19:58.890
Yusei!

00:19:59.390 --> 00:20:05.400
I'm not allowed to lose against a 
piece of garbage from Satellite!

00:20:05.400 --> 00:20:06.870
Yusei!

00:20:08.670 --> 00:20:10.210
You're…?

00:20:10.210 --> 00:20:12.420
Stop interfering!

00:20:14.090 --> 00:20:15.300
Hurry!

00:20:15.680 --> 00:20:16.670
Saiga…

00:20:16.670 --> 00:20:20.000
Deal the final blow for your friends!

00:20:20.120 --> 00:20:21.410
Saiga…

00:20:23.580 --> 00:20:26.090
Connect the bond!

00:20:27.380 --> 00:20:29.650
Go, Turbo Warrior.

00:20:31.610 --> 00:20:33.850
Attack Goyo Guardian.

00:20:37.540 --> 00:20:40.360
Break through!  Accel Slash!

00:20:55.660 --> 00:20:57.220
Saiga!

00:20:57.230 --> 00:21:00.190
Go! Don't worry about me!

00:21:00.480 --> 00:21:02.270
Go!

00:21:15.200 --> 00:21:16.360
What's wrong?

00:21:22.060 --> 00:21:24.470
Luca!

00:21:37.770 --> 00:21:40.790
Luca, who is he?

00:22:04.280 --> 00:22:09.860
What can we grasp?  What can we do?

00:22:10.220 --> 00:22:15.250
We'll step forward and find out

00:22:15.630 --> 00:22:21.180
My unstoppable emotions, the 
beating of my passionate heart

00:22:21.340 --> 00:22:26.420
I heard the voice of truth

00:22:26.610 --> 00:22:29.580
After I was hurt, I learned

00:22:32.150 --> 00:22:35.170
Of a place where I can become stronger

00:22:37.120 --> 00:22:42.330
I stack my dreams in my palm

00:22:42.460 --> 00:22:47.730
And I'll someday pass them to you

00:22:48.160 --> 00:22:53.670
Seeking for the signal 
to start, my soul roars

00:22:53.970 --> 00:22:59.010
I will overcome my suffocating 
and mediocre life

00:22:59.570 --> 00:23:05.100
I'll dash and acquire all the bright futures

00:23:05.250 --> 00:23:14.520
Carrying the bonds I believe 
in, I run towards tomorrow
